ame":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"qb28j-FNX1_6xm7u372TZA","review_id":"XzHPTS118jsxLLjzH_yo0w","date":"2016-05-06T01:39:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9603865742683411,"text_excerpt":"While looking for a good spot to grab dinner, my boyfriend and I came across the Gumbo Shop. The seating area is very spacious but tables are pretty close to one another. The outside seating area is very quaint and great on a warmer night. Their menu has a lot to choose from, and we couldn't really decide on what to get so we just went with their complete creole dinner, which lets us try a little bit of everything. It comes with basically four items (you have a list to choose from) and was enough for both of us since we weren't extremely hungry to begin with. Our waiter started each of us off with their chicken andouille gumbo in a cup. I'm not really sure if this was on the house because..."},{"business_id":"qb28j-FNX1_6xm7u372TZA","review_id":"dllYajPmSWO4J41aMi2WGQ","date":"2019-08-13T13:36:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9586560726165771,"text_excerpt":"This was the first place we went to when we got to NOLA. I've heard that they have the best gumbo in the area so I decided to order it. I got the chicken andouille gumbo, but I was also able to try the seafood okra gumbo. It was a good portion and had the perfect blend of spice and seasonings. I've never had gumbo in my life, so I'm happy that my first one was from The Gumbo Shop. I also tried the alligator sausage which was flavorful, especially with the sauce it came with. Something I appreciate was that they had a vegan menu to accommodate to more customers with those dietary preferences. The jambalaya had a smaller portion than I thought it would, but was still great nonetheless. Our ..."},{"business_id":"qb28j-FNX1_6xm7u372TZA","review_id":"5U4MbIhj0ubbafU2aniM7A","date":"2018-01-22T20:52:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.957952618598938,"text_excerpt":"Take me to the Gumbo Shop! Not only is the food amazing, but the ambiance and service here is even more splendid. This is an absolute gem in NOLA. We found ourselves here for our last night at 9pm with no wait at all. Their outdoor area feels like you're dining in a garden --so beautiful and romantic. It was perfectly warm with the heating lamps out there even on a cold night. We started off with a bottle of Jacob's Creek Merlot ($28) and their special gumbo of the day: Turkey and Spicy Andouille Gumbo ($5.99) as appetizer. The wine was smooth and the gumbo was tasteful. The cup size was perfect for us to get a little taste before our meal. As for the main entrees, we had the Crawfish Eto..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"qb28j-FNX1_6xm7u372TZA","photo_id":"N_Yp6SghyrXdXqliR3irRg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/N_Yp6SghyrXdXqliR3irRg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8237102031707764},{"business_id":"qb28j-FNX1_6xm7u372TZA","photo_id":"7x5bioN1uXRwixAwmcrasA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7x5bioN1uXRwixAwmcrasA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8233175277709961},{"business_id":"qb28j-FNX1_6xm7u372TZA","photo_id":"m6HkNAHWigVOie41N4Phkg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/m6HkNAHWigVOie41N4Phkg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8205544352531433},{"business_id":"qb28j-FNX1_6xm7u372TZA","photo_id":"DCVbJF4BR-O8_YIMb6